KPL/FK

Inertial frames built into NAIF SPICE, written as TK frames (myb_tkframe, myb/frames.h), so
that binary PCK and SPK files that refer to them by code can be used. J2000 (code 1) is the
root; for the JPL ephemerides and NAIF kernels it is the ICRF.

Source: NAIF, "Frames Required Reading", appendix "Built in inertial reference frames"
(https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/pub/naif/toolkit_docs/C/req/frames.html), after
  J. Lieske, A&A 58, 1 (1977) and 73, 282 (1979) (IAU 1976 precession J2000 -> B1950:
    z = 1153.04066200330", theta = 1002.26108439117", zeta = 1152.84248596724");
  the FK4 equinox offset 0.525" (Fricke);
  Galactic System II: [327 deg]_3 [62.6 deg]_1 [282.25 deg]_3 from FK4;
  obliquity of the ecliptic 84381.448" at J2000 (IAU 1976) and 84404.836" at B1950
  (Explanatory Supplement 1992, pp. 114 and 171).
Every rotation agrees with CSPICE N0067 (tests/unit/test_tkframe.c).

Conventions: TKFRAME_<id>_ANGLES (a1 a2 a3) with _AXES (i1 i2 i3) give the rotation from the
frame to its RELATIVE frame, [a1]_i1 [a2]_i2 [a3]_i3. NAIF's DE-xxx frames (codes 4 .. 12,
14, 15, 19 .. 21) and MARSIAU (16) are not included.

\begindata

FRAME_J2000              = 1
FRAME_1_NAME             = 'J2000'

FRAME_B1950              = 2
FRAME_2_NAME             = 'B1950'
TKFRAME_2_RELATIVE       = 'J2000'
TKFRAME_2_SPEC           = 'ANGLES'
TKFRAME_2_ANGLES         = ( -1153.04066200330  1002.26108439117  -1152.84248596724 )
TKFRAME_2_AXES           = ( 3 2 3 )
TKFRAME_2_UNITS          = 'ARCSECONDS'

FRAME_FK4                = 3
FRAME_3_NAME             = 'FK4'
TKFRAME_3_RELATIVE       = 'B1950'
TKFRAME_3_SPEC           = 'ANGLES'
TKFRAME_3_ANGLES         = ( -0.525 0 0 )
TKFRAME_3_AXES           = ( 3 1 3 )
TKFRAME_3_UNITS          = 'ARCSECONDS'

FRAME_GALACTIC           = 13
FRAME_13_NAME            = 'GALACTIC'
TKFRAME_13_RELATIVE      = 'FK4'
TKFRAME_13_SPEC          = 'ANGLES'
TKFRAME_13_ANGLES        = ( -282.25 -62.6 -327 )
TKFRAME_13_AXES          = ( 3 1 3 )
TKFRAME_13_UNITS         = 'DEGREES'

FRAME_ECLIPJ2000         = 17
FRAME_17_NAME            = 'ECLIPJ2000'
TKFRAME_17_RELATIVE      = 'J2000'
TKFRAME_17_SPEC          = 'ANGLES'
TKFRAME_17_ANGLES        = ( -84381.448 0 0 )
TKFRAME_17_AXES          = ( 1 3 1 )
TKFRAME_17_UNITS         = 'ARCSECONDS'

FRAME_ECLIPB1950         = 18
FRAME_18_NAME            = 'ECLIPB1950'
TKFRAME_18_RELATIVE      = 'B1950'
TKFRAME_18_SPEC          = 'ANGLES'
TKFRAME_18_ANGLES        = ( -84404.836 0 0 )
TKFRAME_18_AXES          = ( 1 3 1 )
TKFRAME_18_UNITS         = 'ARCSECONDS'

\begintext
